    cml:premiseText "(3) A scheme may be a pyramid scheme:  (a) no matter who holds out to new participants the prospect of entitlement to recruitment payments; and  (b) no matter who is to make recruitment payments to new participants; and  (c) no matter who is to make introductions to the scheme of further new participants." ;
