concept:act-sch-2-sec-240-2-ss-1 cml:asserts concept:act-sch-2-sec-240-2-ss-1-logic-deontic-1 .
concept:act-sch-2-sec-240-2-ss-1-logic-deontic-1 a cml:LogicApplication ;
    cml:modality cml:Deontic ;
    cml:operator "consider" ;
    cml:logicSummary "Consider conduct of person and non-party consumers in relation to contravening conduct when determining whether to make an order under section 239(1)" ;
    cml:premiseText "(1) In determining whether to make an order under section 239(1) against a person referred to in section 239(2)(a), the court may have regard to the conduct of the person, and of the non-party consumers in relation to the contravening conduct, since the contravention occurred." ;
    cml:conclusionText "(1) In determining whether to make an order under section 239(1) against a person referred to in section 239(2)(a), the court may have regard to the conduct of the person, and of the non-party consumers in relation to the contravening conduct, since the contravention occurred." ;
    cml:executionSurface "modalities::logic::deontic" ;
    cml:confidence "0.5000"^^xsd:decimal ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed .

